  "description": "Located in the heart of Dubai's iconic World Trade Centre, McGettigan’s offers a lively and welcoming atmosphere for all. Whether you're looking for a relaxed meal with friends, a vibrant spot to watch live sports, or a place to enjoy expertly crafted drinks, McGettigan's has it all. Famous for its authentic Irish hospitality, the venue serves up a delicious menu featuring hearty Irish classics, international favorites, and refreshing beverages. Enjoy live entertainment, DJ nights, and a variety of events throughout the week in a spacious and modern setting. With its friendly service and great atmosphere, McGettigan’s Dubai World Trade Centre is the perfect destination for any occasion—whether you're here for a casual drink, a family meal, or a night out with friends. Join us for great food, cold drinks, and unforgettable memories!",
